WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.791
Unit two. Community Health Advocacy!

2
00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:09.678
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.729 --> 00:00:13.653
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.703 --> 00:00:18.835
Today we learn about Community Health Advocacy. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.878 --> 00:00:24.078
Advocacy. Say it with me. Advocacy!

6
00:00:27.561 --> 00:00:31.895
Health campaign. Say it with me. Health campaign!

7
00:00:35.361 --> 00:00:39.595
Awareness. Say it with me. Awareness!

8
00:00:43.099 --> 00:00:47.782
Grassroots effort. Say it with me. Grassroots effort!

9
00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:55.996
Policy change. Say it with me. Policy change!

10
00:00:59.507 --> 00:01:03.623
Volunteer. Say it with me. Volunteer!

11
00:01:07.141 --> 00:01:11.391
Community leader. Say it with me. Community leader!

12
00:01:14.896 --> 00:01:19.496
Civic action. Say it with me. Civic action!

13
00:01:22.996 --> 00:01:40.742
Advocacy means speaking up to improve health in a community. A health campaign can raise awareness through a grassroots effort. Volunteering and supporting policy change are two forms of civic action a community leader might take.

14
00:01:40.792 --> 00:01:44.267
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:44.989 --> 00:01:50.405
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:50.455 --> 00:01:51.682
Awareness!

17
00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:57.855
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:57.905 --> 00:01:59.400
Community leader!

19
00:02:00.714 --> 00:02:08.700
Did you know? Many major public health improvements, like seatbelt laws, started as grassroots advocacy campaigns.

20
00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:11.123
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:12.205 --> 00:02:21.501
Think and answer. What health issue would you like to advocate for in your community?

22
00:02:21.551 --> 00:02:22.701
Great answer!

23
00:02:23.658 --> 00:02:28.761
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:28.811 --> 00:02:31.597
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

